# Changelog

_Public versions preserve the evidence and its interpretation._

## 📦 0.1.0 — 2026-10-16

- Publish the external comparison protocol in English and French
- Release every fixed-trace controller series and an explicit four-largest-case CPU subset
- Provide reproducible arithmetic, file integrity checks and evidence-rejection tests
- Include raw timing data, provenance, figures and blank comparison templates
- Distinguish controller overhead, frozen-program core scaling and future learning experiments

This release does not distribute the internal engine, evaluated binaries or protected inputs. It demonstrates recalculation of the published observations; it does not claim independent end-to-end reproduction or a general performance ranking.
